        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Mighty Patch Surface takes the familiar hydrocolloid pimple patch and scales it up for larger or clustered breakouts. Each rectangular patch measures <strong>60 x 25 mm</strong>—over two inches long—and can be used on areas such as the cheek, forehead, chin, jawline, neck, back, and chest. Hydrocolloid absorbs fluid from surfaced blemishes while the covering also discourages touching, picking, and popping. The patches are particularly suited to <strong>whiteheads and larger breakout zones</strong> rather than deep, under-the-skin acne. Hero recommends applying them to clean, dry skin and leaving them on for several hours or overnight. The flexible, tapered design helps the patch conform to different areas, while each package contains 10 patches. They’re also vegan and cruelty-free.</p>",
